You know, I got up really quickly today.
I went into the kitchen.
There I made myself a lunch.
I made a Brötchen with cheese.
Then I packed everything into my backpack.
Of course, I also packed my water bottle.
After that, I went into the hallway.
I felt the warm air already in the morning.
So I left my winter coat in the wardrobe.
I only put on a thin jacket.
And I put on my light shoes.
I wore them today for the first time this year.
That felt really great!
Then I went out of the flat.
I closed the door.
I went down the stairs.
On the street, the sun shone on my face.
From there I walked to the station.
